0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志：馮翊夏陽縣，故少梁。師古曰：本梁國，爲秦所滅，至惠文王十一年，更名夏陽。康曰：魏有大梁，故此稱「少」以別之。少，詩沼翻。夏，戶雅翻。更，工衡翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志：冯翊夏阳县，故少梁。师古曰：本梁国，为秦所灭，至惠文王十一年，更名夏阳。康曰：魏有大梁，故此称「少」以别之。少，诗沼翻。夏，户雅翻。更，工衡翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc72b-db0e-11ef-8fa8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：師大崩曰敗績。痤，才何翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：师大崩曰败绩。痤，才何翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc739-db0e-11ef-890b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8c1dc72a-db0e-11ef-b920-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"cuó","source_anchor_text":"獲魏公孫痤衛聲公薨","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":18,"text":"痤","tongjian_id":"475a1a3a-9fc5-58bc-b71c-add1d615e0a4"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"少梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"少梁","resolved_place_entity_id":3703,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc73d-db0e-11ef-ae4f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"惠文王十七年，更名曰夏阳。汉因置夏阳县。后汉初，邓禹平河...","context_before":"...。文十年，晋伐秦，取少梁。《魏世家》：文侯六年，城少梁。","source_end_index":106,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"28fcc94a-b9b0-50c2-9541-5b0fb31917e8","source_start_index":73,"source_text":"梁惠王九年，与秦战少梁，虏我将公孙座。《秦纪》：秦取魏少梁。是也。"},{"context_after":"即繁庞矣。又籍姑城，《括地志》：在韩城县北三十五里。《史...","context_before":"...在县东南。本秦邑。《史记》：魏文侯十三年，使子击围繁庞。","source_end_index":48,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c731cf52-c32e-50d2-87d4-309cbf02cc2a","source_start_index":32,"source_text":"梁惠王九年，秦败我于少梁，取庞。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2秦、魏戰于少梁，魏師敗績；獲魏公孫痤。","content_fanyi":"秦国和魏国在少梁交战，魏军大败；秦军俘获了魏国将军公孙痤。","content_jianti_auto":"2秦、魏战于少梁，魏师败绩；获魏公孙痤。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":120,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 七年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc72a-db0e-11ef-b920-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-362},"tongjian_id":"8c1dc72a-db0e-11ef-b920-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"少梁","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"元里","place_name_jianti_auto":"元里","place_note":"陝西澄城縣南","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c295ca0-db0e-11ef-a73a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c295ca1-db0e-11ef-b30d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"澄城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"澄城县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c295ca2-db0e-11ef-980d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：元里亦在同州澄城縣界。敗，補邁翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：元里亦在同州澄城县界。败，补迈翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c295c9f-db0e-11ef-9cb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","place_note":"府栎阳，陕西临潼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c295ca5-db0e-11ef-a453-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"秦法戰而斬敵人一首者，賜爵一級，因謂之級。","note_content_jianti_auto":"秦法战而斩敌人一首者，赐爵一级，因谓之级。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c