":51,"tongjian_id":"8c42d044-db0e-11ef-a779-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瑕","place_name_jianti_auto":"瑕","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"8c42d045-db0e-11ef-aad1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桃林","place_name_jianti_auto":"桃林","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c42d046-db0e-11ef-8953-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"8c42d047-db0e-11ef-a781-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲沃","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲沃","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"8c42d048-db0e-11ef-b6a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曲沃","place_name_jianti_auto":"曲沃","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8c42d049-db0e-11ef-9712-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"焦","place_name_jianti_auto":"焦","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04a-db0e-11ef-9b28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"焦國","place_name_jianti_auto":"焦国","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04b-db0e-11ef-86f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"焦城","place_name_jianti_auto":"焦城","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04c-db0e-11ef-8b44-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陝城","place_name_jianti_auto":"陕城","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04d-db0e-11ef-95ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"焦水","place_name_jianti_auto":"焦水","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04e-db0e-11ef-90bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"8c42d04f-db0e-11ef-b380-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，弘農郡陝縣有焦城，左傳所謂「晉與秦焦、瑕」者也。括地志：焦在陝城東百步。曲沃在陝西南三十二里，因曲沃水爲名。酈道元曰：案春秋文公十三年，晉侯使詹嘉處瑕，守桃林之塞以備秦，時以曲沃之官守之，故曲沃之名遂爲積古之傳。宋白曰：焦，古焦國。括地志：焦城在陝城東北百步，因焦水爲名；周同姓所封。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，弘农郡陕县有焦城，左传所谓「晋与秦焦、瑕」者也。括地志：焦在陕城东百步。曲沃在陕西南三十二里，因曲沃水为名。郦道元曰：案春秋文公十三年，晋侯使詹嘉处瑕，守桃林之塞以备秦，时以曲沃之官守之，故曲沃之名遂为积古之传。宋白曰：焦，古焦国。括地志：焦城在陕城东北百步，因焦水为名；周同姓所封。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c42d032-db0e-11ef-b693-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c42d056-db0e-11ef-83ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河西","place_name_jianti_auto":"河西","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c42d057-db0e-11ef-b01a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c42d058-db0e-11ef-97fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"少，詩照翻。二十九年，魏已使使獻河西於秦以和，今乃入其地。","note_content_jianti_auto":"少，诗照翻。二十九年，魏已使使献河西于秦以和，今乃入其地。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c42d055-db0e-11ef-a972-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"少梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"少梁","place_note":"陝西韓城西南","resolved_place_entity_id":3703,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c42d05e-db0e-11ef-a905-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/序","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦昭襄二十一年，安邑复入秦，而魏遂不复振矣。秦人既得安邑...","context_before":"...，则以晋阳及云中、九原。自魏去安邑，都大梁，而魏始弱矣。","source_end_index":695,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"72077296-9784-5719-b078-2e0a63e7f383","source_start_index":672,"source_text":"秦惠文君时，魏以河西之地，尽入于秦，而魏益弱。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/序","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"六年，秦取我焦。八年，秦归我焦、曲沃。焦与曲沃相近也。又...","context_before":"...阴地及诸侯之师侵郑。盖自焦而东，河南山北之处，皆阴地也。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"aa5d2035-55e1-5efb-b0ca-85013562b9a7","source_start_index":103,"source_text":"《史记》：梁襄王五年，秦围我焦、曲沃，与秦河西之地。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"六年，秦取我焦。八年，秦归我焦、曲沃。焦与曲沃相近也。又...","context_before":"...阴地及诸侯之师侵郑。盖自焦而东，河南山北之处，皆阴地也。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"91d75585-ba8f-5a37-adf9-38061b98737f","source_start_index":103,"source_text":"《史记》：梁襄王五年，秦围我焦、曲沃，与秦河西之地。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉初，自临晋东渡河以争中原。东汉初，邓禹亦繇此入关中。西...","context_before":"...沮水，又密迩河中，常为孔道。春秋之季，秦晋每角逐于河西。","source_end_index":109,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2676776a-9d7b-507a-a89b-617b75c0dee1","source_start_index":46,"source_text":"战国时，秦与魏人争河西地，既得河西，三晋之患日迫矣[《史记》：梁哀王五年，予秦河西地。《正义》：自华州北至同州，魏河西地也]。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1秦伐魏，圍焦、曲沃。魏入少梁、河西地於秦。","content_fanyi":"秦国攻打魏国，包围焦邑和曲沃。魏国将少梁与河西两地割让给秦国。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦伐魏，围焦、曲沃。魏入少梁、河西地于秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":200,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十九年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c42d031-db0e-11ef-93de-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-330},"tongjian_id":"8c42d031-db0e-11ef-93de-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":3},"place_name":"少梁"},"message":"success","success":true}